message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "seismic-response"
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  Evaluate seismological instrument responses (StationXML, SEED RESP, SAC poles-and-zeros)
  with evalresp-compatible output. Pure Python library, evalresp-compatible command line,
  and an interactive GUI that also runs entirely in the browser.
